      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/InfernoYTA/status/2023468945391710349",
      "text": "Higher RPM comes from audience demographics more than niche.\n\nTwo finance channels, same topics, different RPM. \n\nCuz one pulls US/UK/Canada traffic, one pulls India/Philippines traffic.\n\nUS viewers generate $18-25 RPM.\n\n India viewers generate $2-6 RPM. \n\nSame content but 5x difference.\n\nHow to control this: Title and thumbnail in English obviously attracts English-speaking markets but topic selection matters more. \n\n\"How to invest $10k\" attracts US audience. \n\n\"Budget investing tips\" attracts international audience.\n\nThis way YOU choose your RPM.",
