      "quoted_tweet": {
        "type": "tweet",
        "id": "2023103041252331975",
        "url": "https://x.com/InfernoYTA/status/2023103041252331975",
        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/InfernoYTA/status/2023103041252331975",
        "text": "Switching niches mid-channel is way less scary than people think.\n\nSeen channels move from phone reviews to SaaS breakdowns. \n\nTakes about 3 weeks for the algorithm to adjust but RPM jumps from $7 to $19.\n\nYouTube doesn't care that you pivoted. It cares if your new content performs. If retention and CTR stay solid, the algorithm adapts fast.\n\nThe only risk is that your existing audience might not care about the new topics.\n\n But if your RPM doubles, losing 30% of subs doesn't matter lol.",
